.TH POCKET-POSSUM 1 "2026" "pocket-possum" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pocket-possum \- Possum Operational ScreenSaver: animated screensaver and live wallpaper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pocket-possum
[\fIOPTION\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows an animated moonlit porch scene starring a possum (or a cat, raccoon, dog or lizard) and a chaotic family,
with day and night, four seasons and optional real weather sync.
With no option, the settings dialog opens.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-screensaver
Full-screen screensaver on every monitor. Exits on any key press, click, scroll or noticeable mouse movement.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-wallpaper
Live desktop background on every monitor. Works on X11 (and XWayland); native Wayland desktops do not allow it.
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-window
Show the scene in a normal window.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-settings
Open the settings dialog.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-watch
Run the idle watcher: start the screensaver after the configured idle time and manage the live wallpaper.
Needs \fBxprintidle\fR and an X11 session.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " FILE"
Render the scene, save a PNG to \fIFILE\fR and exit. Useful for testing.
.TP
.BI \-\-delay " MS"
Milliseconds to wait before the screenshot (default 4000).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/PocketPossum/settings.json
Settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/PocketPossum/log.txt
Diagnostics, including page script errors and what the animals are up to.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B POSSUM_SOFTWARE
Set to force software rendering in WebKit.
.TP
.B POSSUM_URL_EXTRA
Extra query parameters appended to the page URL, for example \fBwxtest=95\fR to fake a thunderstorm.
.SH PRIVACY
Weather sync is off by default. When enabled, the coordinates of the chosen location are sent over HTTPS to
open-meteo.com about every 15 minutes (and the city search sends the text you type to its geocoding service).
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/TPandaGames/possum-live-wallpaper
